<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Controlled Teleport</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 35)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast controlled teleport &lt;someone, something or a place&gt;
</pre>
<p>Takes you, in a puff of green smoke, to a person, a creature, an object or a 
place anywhere in the world, any land at all, across the sea too: the 
stronger brother of transport. It can't take you out of a place magic can't 
leave, nor into one magic can't reach; then you get most of the mana back.
</p><p>Beware the rift: about one cast in twenty tears a hole in the powers of 
magic. All your mana is gone, and you may be thrown somewhere else, into the 
void, or something may come through the rift at you.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
